sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Officer as Election Officer / Admin
    participant UI as Admin Console
    participant Ctrl as Election Controller
    participant ElSvc as ElectionService
    participant ElRepo as ElectionRepository
    participant ResSvc as ResultsService
    participant Exporter as CSVExporter
    participant DB as MariaDB / MySQL

    Officer->>UI: Click "Close Election" (or automated server deadline reached)
    UI->>Ctrl: POST /admin/elections/status (status: 'closed')
    Ctrl->>ElSvc: transitionState(electionId, 'closed', officerId)
    ElSvc->>ElRepo: updateStatus(electionId, 'closed')
    ElRepo->>DB: UPDATE elections SET status = 'closed' WHERE id = ?
    Note over DB: No further votes can be cast

    Officer->>UI: Review provisional tallies and click "Publish Official Results"
    UI->>Ctrl: POST /admin/elections/status (status: 'results_published')
    Ctrl->>ElSvc: transitionState(electionId, 'results_published', officerId)
    ElSvc->>ElRepo: updateStatus(electionId, 'results_published')
    ElRepo->>DB: UPDATE elections SET status = 'results_published' WHERE id = ?
    
    Officer->>UI: Request Certified Tally CSV Export
    UI->>Ctrl: GET /admin/reports/csv?id=12
    Ctrl->>ResSvc: generateResultsCsv(electionId)
    ResSvc->>DB: Tally ballots & turnout
    ResSvc->>Exporter: generate(headers, rows with formula injection escaping)
    Exporter-->>Officer: Download sanitized CSV spreadsheet file
